{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13189","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13189/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13189/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13189/events","html_url":"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13189","id":3706537797,"node_id":"I_kwDOAI0trM7c7UdF","number":13189,"title":"[css-values-5] Unit cycles via if()","user":{"login":"andruud","id":77163,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77163?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud","html_url":"https://github.com/andruud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":395785926,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzOTU3ODU5MjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/labels/Closed%20Accepted%20as%20Obvious%20Bugfix","name":"Closed Accepted as Obvious Bugfix","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"Fixed an obvious error with the obvious solution.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":469426704,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0Njk0MjY3MDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/labels/Needs%20Edits","name":"Needs Edits","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":971551685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NzE1NTE2ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/labels/css-values-5","name":"css-values-5","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-12-08T14:03:45Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T20:56:37Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I think we're missing some cycle detection handling for `if()`. In the following example, the `writing-mode` depends on the computed `font-size`, and vice-versa:\n\n```css\n:root {\n  width: 100px;\n  height: 80px;\n}\n\ndiv {\n  writing-mode: if(\n    style(1em = 10px): vertical-rl;\n    else: horizontal-tb);\n  font-size: calc(100vi / 10);\n}\n```\n\nAs of https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/6026, we can run into cycles via `overflow`, `scrollbar-gutter`, and `scrollbar-width` as well, e.g.:\n\n```css\n:root {\n  width: 100px;\n  overflow: if(\n    style(100px = 100vw): scroll;\n    else: hidden;\n  );\n}\n```\n\nWe should be able to fix this by [guarding](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-5/#guarded) the appropriate substitution context for a given unit seen in the `<style-query>`. For example, `style(1em = ...)` would guard `font-size`; `style(1vw = ...)` would guard `scrollbar-gutter`, and `scrollbar-width` on the root element; `style(1vi = ...)` would guard `writing-mode`.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13189/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13189/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}